OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright and mainly dry day
OL,6,Fwith some sunny intervals at times.
OL,7,FThere could be the odd brief heavy
OL,8,Fshower, most likely over Argyll. Very
OL,9,Fwarm or hot.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with just the chance of the
OL,13,Fodd shower. Some heavy showers
OL,14,Fovernight, mostly for Argyll. Rather
OL,15,Fcloudy for Argyll, some clear spells
OL,16,Fpossible elsewhere.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FWarm or very warm and mainly
OL,19,Fbright and sunny, just the odd sharp
OL,20,Fshower possible. Mostly cloudy with
OL,21,Foccasionally heavy showers in far west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
